  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "保險學",
    "sub_ename": "INSURANCE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講授風險與保險學的基本理論與實務運用。首先介紹風險性質、傳統風險管理與整合型風險管理之發展；再介紹保險制度的基本運作原則及保險監理，最後個別介紹人身保險與非人身保險概論及其個案例證",
    "describe_eh": "Risk and Insurance theory as well as practical are introduced in this course. In the first section including: risk, integrated risk management and its development. In the 2nd section including insurance contract, basic principles and government regulation. Lastly, Life insurane and Non-life insurance are Introduced respectively and comprehensive cases are also illustrated.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學生能說明保險原理與認識保險契約的專業知識進而瞭解保險與租稅規劃的相關性 \t",
      "describe_en": "Enable to interpret insurance theory and insurance contract. Even understanding the relationship between insurance design and tax plan"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "學生能應用專業知識來辨識與分析解決企業與家庭有關保險規劃問題",
      "describe_en": "Enable to distinguish and analyze problems of insurance design for their families and firms"
    }
  ],
